    "The retailer note uses the lower of your explicit offer ceiling and the known shared-allowance maximum. If that maximum is unknown, only your explicit ceiling is used; joint affordability remains unresolved.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The retailer note uses the lower of your explicit offer ceiling and the known shared-allowance maximum. If that maximum is unknown, only your explicit ceiling is used; joint affordability remains unresolved."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La nota para la tienda usa el menor entre tu límite explícito para la oferta y el máximo conocido del límite compartido. Si ese máximo se desconoce, solo se usa tu límite explícito; sigue sin saberse si el conjunto cabe en el presupuesto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The retained original charge consumes this line allowance. It is separate from the maximum price authorized for the replacement.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
