          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you choose to participate, the household service stores your response codes, shop identity, eligible week and this notice version. It can match verified membership status once per household to study purchase retention. Grocery text, prices, member names and existing local responses are not sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you choose to participate, the household service stores your response codes, shop identity, eligible week and this notice version. It can match verified membership status once per household to study purchase retention. Grocery text, prices, member names and existing local responses are not sent."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si decides participar, el servicio del hogar guarda los códigos de respuesta, la identidad de la compra, la semana elegible y la versión de este aviso. Puede vincular el estado verificado de la membresía una vez por hogar para estudiar la permanencia de las compras. No se envían textos de alimentos, precios, nombres de miembros ni respuestas locales existentes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Participation is optional. You can keep using the entire pickup without sending feedback. Withdrawal removes responses sent under that consent and stops counting your participation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Participation is optional. You can keep using the entire pickup without sending feedback. Withdrawal removes responses sent under that consent and stops counting your participation."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La participación es opcional. Puedes seguir usando toda la recogida sin enviar comentarios. Retirar el consentimiento elimina las respuestas enviadas con ese consentimiento y deja de contar tu participación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
